msgid "django-cotton is not installed"
msgstr "django-cotton ez dago instalatuta"

#: setup_check.py:45
msgid ""
"django-cotton-gallery is built on top of django-cotton. Install and "
"configure cotton in your Django project, then refresh this page. The cotton "
"quickstart walks you through the install, INSTALLED_APPS entry, and template "
"loader setup in a few steps."
msgstr ""
"django-cotton-gallery django-cotton-en gainean eraikia dago. Instalatu eta "
"konfiguratu cotton zure Django proiektuan, eta gero birkargatu orri hau. "
"Cotton-en hasiera azkarrak instalazioan, INSTALLED_APPS sarreran eta "
"template loader-aren konfigurazioan zehar gidatzen zaitu urrats gutxitan."

