msgid "This component doesn't define any slots."
msgstr "Osagai honek ez du slotik definitzen."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:486
msgid ""
"<code>@ignore-unused</code> — nothing references this component, but it's "
"<strong>intentionally</strong> unreferenced here, so Insights won't flag it "
"as a zombie."
msgstr ""
"<code>@ignore-unused</code> — ezerk ez du osagai hau erreferentziatzen, "
"baina <strong>nahita</strong> dago erreferentziarik gabe hemen, beraz "
"Insights-ek ez du zonbi gisa markatuko."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:488
msgid ""
"<code>@ignore-unused</code> is set, but this component <strong>is</strong> "
"referenced — the flag has no effect here."
msgstr ""
"<code>@ignore-unused</code> ezarrita dago, baina osagai hau <strong>bai</"
"strong> dago erreferentziatuta — banderak ez du eraginik hemen."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:491
msgid ""
"<strong>Zombie</strong> — nothing in the catalog or your templates "
"references this component. If that's intentional (a library or WIP "
"component), add <code>&#123;# @ignore-unused #&#125;</code> to silence this."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Zonbia</strong> — ez katalogoan ez zure txantiloietan ezerk ez du "
"osagai hau erreferentziatzen. Nahita bada (liburutegi- edo WIP-osagai bat), "
"gehitu <code>&#123;# @ignore-unused #&#125;</code> hau isilarazteko."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:495
msgid "Uses"
msgstr "Erabiltzen ditu"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:498
msgid ""
"<strong>What this component needs.</strong> Each item is another catalog "
"component referenced via <code>&lt;c-X.Y&gt;</code> inside this template — "
"delete one and this template stops rendering."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Osagai honek behar duena.</strong> Sarrera bakoitza katalogoko beste "
"osagai bat da <code>&lt;c-X.Y&gt;</code> bidez txantiloi honetan "
"erreferentziatua — bat ezabatu eta txantiloiak errenderizatzeari uzten dio."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:506
msgid ""
"Standalone — this template doesn't reference any other catalog component."
msgstr ""
"Bakarka — txantiloi honek ez du katalogoko beste inolako osagairik "
"erreferentziatzen."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:511
msgid "Used by"
msgstr "Erabilia"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:514
msgid ""
"<strong>Where this is rendered from</strong> (inside the catalog). Editing "
"this component impacts every entry below — re-check each one before merging."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Nondik errenderizatzen den</strong> (katalogo barruan). Osagai hau "
"editatzeak beheko sarrera bakoitzari eragiten dio."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:522
msgid "Nothing in the catalog renders this component."
msgstr "Katalogoan ezerk ez du osagai hau errenderizatzen."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:527
msgid "External usage"
msgstr "Kanpoko erabilera"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:530
msgid ""
"<strong>Consumer-side renderers.</strong> Templates in your project's "
"<code>templates/</code> (outside the catalog) that include this component. "
"Catches usage the gallery alone can't see and helps spot zombies."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Kontsumitzailearen errenderizatzaileak.</strong> Zure proiektuaren "
"<code>templates/</code>-eko txantiloiak (katalogotik kanpo) osagai hau barne "
"hartzen dutenak."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:539
msgid "No template outside the catalog references this component."
msgstr ""
"Katalogotik kanpoko txantiloi batek ere ez du osagai hau erreferentziatzen."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:544
msgid ""
"External-templates scanning is disabled by default — the gallery never reads "
"consumer code without explicit consent."
msgstr ""
"Kanpoko txantiloien eskaneatzea lehenetsita desgaituta dago — galeriak ez du "
"inoiz kontsumitzailearen kodea irakurtzen baimenik gabe."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:545
msgid ""
"Set <code>DJANGO_COTTON_GALLERY_SCAN_EXTERNAL_USERS = True</code> in your "
"Django settings to enable. Read-only, dev-only, only template paths are "
"exposed."
msgstr ""
"Ezarri <code>DJANGO_COTTON_GALLERY_SCAN_EXTERNAL_USERS = True</code> zure "
"Django settings-etan gaitzeko. Irakurtzeko soilik, garapenerako soilik, "
"txantiloi-bideak soilik agertzen dira."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:557
msgid "Full impact tree"
msgstr "Eragin zuhaitz osoa"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:558
msgid ""
"The cards above show direct neighbours — this expands the chain recursively. "
"Click any branch to drill in."
msgstr ""
"Goiko txartelek auzokide zuzenak erakusten dituzte — honek katea "
"errekurtsiboki zabaltzen du. Edozein adarra sakatu sakontzeko."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:563
msgid "Reverse impact (Used by, recursive)"
msgstr "Alderantzizko eragina (Used by, errekurtsiboa)"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:564
msgid ""
"<strong>Walks backwards.</strong> Every component listed (at any depth) "
"consumes this one transitively — touch this template and each of them must "
"be re-tested."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Atzera doa.</strong> Zerrendatutako osagai bakoitzak (edozein "
"sakoneretan) hau transitiboki kontsumitzen du — txantiloi hau ukitu eta "
"bakoitza berriz probatu behar da."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:570
msgid "Forward needs (Uses, recursive)"
msgstr "Aurrerantzeko beharrak (Uses, errekurtsiboa)"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:571
msgid ""
"<strong>Walks forwards.</strong> The complete chain of catalog components "
"this template needs to render successfully — every leaf is a base dependency."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Aurrera doa.</strong> Txantiloi honek behar dituen katalogo osagaien "
"kate osoa — hosto bakoitza oinarrizko mendekotasuna da."

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/detail.html:582
msgid "Copy source"
msgstr "Kopiatu iturburua"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/docs.html:10
msgid "Reference"
msgstr "Erreferentzia"

#: templates/django_cotton_gallery/docs.html:12
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Everything that's configurable. <strong>Configuration</strong> covers the "
"consumer settings you put in <code>settings.py</code> — file location, "
"ordering, asset injection. <strong>Annotations</strong> covers the "
"<code>&#123;# @prop ... #&#125;</code> grammar the gallery's parser reads to "
"build interactive controls. New here? Start with <a href=\"%(url)s\">Get "
"started</a>."
msgstr ""
"Konfiguragarria den guztia. <strong>Konfigurazioak</strong> <code>settings."
"py</code>-n jartzen dituzun kontsumitzaile-ezarpenak biltzen ditu — "
"fitxategi-kokapena, ordenazioa, aktiboen injekzioa. <strong>Oharrek</strong> "
"galeriaren parser-ak kontrol interaktiboak eraikitzeko irakurtzen duen "
"<code>&#123;# @prop ... #&#125;</code> gramatika biltzen du. Berria zara "
"hemen? Hasi <a href=\"%(url)s\">Hasi</a>-rekin."

